# Paths (repo roots or sub-directories) that blossom does not need and that are
# only deleted by scripts/trim.py when NOTHING outside the removed set refers to
# them (module names in Android.bp / Android.mk, or their path in a .bp/.mk).
# Anything that is still referenced is kept automatically, so a wrong guess here
# costs build time, never a broken build.
# One path per line, relative to the source root. '#' starts a comment.

# --- Automotive / TV ---
packages/apps/Car
packages/services/Car
frameworks/opt/car
frameworks/opt/tv
packages/apps/TV
device/generic/car
device/google_car
device/google/atv
device/google/trout
hardware/interfaces/automotive
hardware/interfaces/tv

